---
// Greydemar Serrano - Hero Centrado & Fondo Ávila
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  
  <title>Greydemar Serrano | Marketing & Project Manager</title>
  <meta name="title" content="Greydemar Serrano | Marketing & Project Manager">
  <meta name="description" content="Especialista en Growth Marketing, Creación de Contenido y Project Management.">

  <!-- FAVICON -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><rect width='100' height='100' rx='50' fill='%23FEF08A'/><text x='50%' y='62%' font-size='42' font-weight='900' font-family='sans-serif' fill='%230F172A' text-anchor='middle'>GS</text></svg>" />

  <!-- FUENTES -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

  <!-- FONDO CON EL ÁVILA -->
  <div class="hero-bg-wrapper">
    <div class="avila-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- CABECERA -->
  <header class="top-header">
    <div class="brand-centered">GREY SERRANO®</div>
    
    <div class="lang-switch">
      <button class="lang-btn active" onclick="setLanguage('es')">ES</button>
      <span class="lang-divider">|</span>
      <button class="lang-btn" onclick="setLanguage('en')">EN</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- SECCIÓN HERO COMPLETA -->
  <main class="hero-container">
    
    <!-- TARJETA DESPLEGABLE IZQUIERDA -->
    <div class="glass-profile-card" tabindex="0">
      <div class="card-min-header">
        <img src="/grey.jpeg" alt="Greydemar Serrano" class="profile-thumb" />
        <div class="min-meta">
          <div class="status-line">
            <span class="green-dot"></span>
            <span class="status-text" data-es="En línea" data-en="Online">En línea</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="min-name">GREYDEMAR SERRANO – MARKETING SPECIALIST</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card-expand-content">
        <p class="expand-bio" 
           data-es="Marketing para atraer + Ventas para facturar + Web para escalar. No hago ruido, construyo ecosistemas rentables. Conecto contenido de alto impacto con sistemas de cierre comercial y plataformas ultrarrápidas. Mi objetivo: eliminar la fricción, posicionar tu autoridad y multiplicar tus conversiones." 
           data-en="Marketing to attract + Sales to invoice + Web to scale. I don't just make noise, I build profitable ecosystems. I connect high-impact content with commercial closing systems and ultra-fast platforms. My goal: eliminate friction, position your authority, and multiply your conversions.">
          Marketing para atraer + Ventas para facturar + Web para escalar. No hago ruido, construyo ecosistemas rentables. Conecto contenido de alto impacto con sistemas de cierre comercial y plataformas ultrarrápidas. Mi objetivo: eliminar la fricción, posicionar tu autoridad y multiplicar tus conversiones.
        </p>
        
        <!-- SKILLS ORGANIZADOS EN CUADRÍCULA -->
        <div class="skills-grid">
          <span>Meta Business</span>
          <span>Canva Pro</span>
          <span>CapCut Pro</span>
          <span>SEO</span>
          <span>Astro</span>
          <span>HTML & CSS</span>
          <span>JavaScript</span>
          <span>GitHub / Vercel</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FRASE GANCHO (Debajo del perfil en Desktop, debajo de casos en Móvil) -->
    <div class="quote-text">
      <em data-es='"Facturar no es casualidad. Depende de cómo te ven, cómo conectas y qué tan fácil les haces comprar."' data-en='"Invoicing is no accident. It depends on how they see you, how you connect, and how easy you make it to buy."'>
        "Facturar no es casualidad. Depende de cómo te ven, cómo conectas y qué tan fácil les haces comprar."
      </em>
    </div>

    <!-- TÍTULO PRINCIPAL CENTRADO Y BLANCO -->
    <div class="hero-center-text">
      <h1 data-es="ESTRATEGIA QUE UNE MARKETING, VENTAS Y WEB" data-en="STRATEGY BRIDGING MARKETING, SALES & WEB">
        ESTRATEGIA QUE UNE MARKETING, VENTAS Y WEB
      </h1>

      <span class="floating-pill pill-pink">Growth Marketing</span>
      <span class="floating-pill pill-green">Project Manager</span>
      <span class="floating-pill pill-yellow">Visual Content</span>
    </div>

    <!-- TARJETA DESPLEGABLE DERECHA -->
    <div class="glass-cases-card" tabindex="0">
      <div class="cases-min-header">
        <span class="cases-title-text" data-es="Casos Destacados" data-en="Featured Cases">Casos Destacados</span>
        <span class="search-icon-wrapper">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
            <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="cases-expand-content">
        <ul class="quick-cases-list">
          <li>
            <a href="#projects">
              <strong>YP Realty</strong>
              <span>Growth +604%</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#projects">
              <strong>Eurobuilding</strong>
              <span>Estrategia & Branding</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#projects">
              <strong>Impaktemos</strong>
              <span>Marketing & Conversión</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#projects">
              <strong>Editorial PanHouse</strong>
              <span>Comunicaciones & VIP</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#projects">
              <strong>Dislocal</strong>
              <span>Project Coordinator</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <!-- BARRA FLOTANTE DOCK -->
  <nav class="floating-dock">
    <ul class="dock-list">
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Sobre mí">
        <a href="#about" class="dock-link"><img src="/notas.webp" class="mac-icon" alt="Notas"></a>
      </li>
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Casos">
        <a href="#projects" class="dock-link"><img src="/foto.png" class="mac-icon" alt="Fotos"></a>
      </li>
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Servicios">
        <a href="#services" class="dock-link"><img src="/finder icon.png" class="mac-icon" alt="Finder"></a>
      </li>
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Contacto">
        <a href="mailto:greydemar@email.com" class="dock-link"><img src="/ICON MAIL.webp" class="mac-icon" alt="Mail"></a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <script is:inline>
    function setLanguage(lang) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.lang-btn').forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
      event.target.classList.add('active');

      document.querySelectorAll('[data-es]').forEach(el => {
        el.textContent = el.getAttribute(`data-${lang}`);
      });
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --navy-dark: #0f172a;
    --pastel-yellow: #fef08a;
    --pastel-pink: #fbcfe8;
    --pastel-green: #bbf7d0;
    
    --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    --glass-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    color: var(--navy-dark);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .hero-bg-wrapper {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    background: url('/avila.jpg') no-repeat center center / cover;
    z-index: -2;
  }

  .avila-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); /* Ligeramente oscurecido para resaltar el H1 blanco */
  }

  .top-header {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 100;
  }

  .brand-centered {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #ffffff; /* Ajustado a blanco por el fondo */
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .lang-switch {
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
  }

  .lang-btn { background: none; border: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; color: #334155; cursor: pointer; }
  .lang-btn.active { color: var(--navy-dark); font-weight: 900; }
  .lang-divider { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; }

  /* SISTEMA DE GRILLA ACTUALIZADO PARA ACOMODAR LA FRASE */
  .hero-container {
    max-width: 1300px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: auto auto;
    padding: 20px 32px 100px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr 260px;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start; /* Ajuste para la frase inferior */
    position: relative;
  }

  /* TARJETA IZQUIERDA */
  .glass-profile-card {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .card-min-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  
  /* ANIMACIÓN DE LA IMAGEN DE PERFIL */
  .profile-thumb { 
    width: 42px; 
    height: 42px; 
    border-radius: 50%; 
    object-fit: cover; 
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); 
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); 
  }
  
  .glass-profile-card:hover .profile-thumb,
  .glass-profile-card:focus .profile-thumb {
    transform: scale(1.3) translateX(3px) translateY(3px); /* Se amplía sin empujar los textos */
  }

  .status-line { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .green-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; }
  .status-text { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; }
  .min-name { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--navy-dark); }

  .card-expand-content {
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .glass-profile-card:hover .card-expand-content,
  .glass-profile-card:focus .card-expand-content {
    max-height: 450px;
    opacity: 1;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  }

  /* TEXTO BIO AMPLIADO Y AUTORITARIO */
  .expand-bio { 
    font-size: 13px; /* Más grande */
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5; 
    color: #1e293b; 
    margin-bottom: 16px; 
  }

  /* GRILLA DE SKILLS PAREJA Y ORGANIZADA */
  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .skills-grid span {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--navy-dark);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }

  /* FRASE GANCHO ITERATIVA */
  .quote-text {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 0 10px;
  }

  /* TÍTULO PRINCIPAL: BLANCO Y CENTRADO */
  .hero-center-text { 
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    text-align: center; 
    position: relative; 
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 40px; 
  }

  .hero-center-text h1 {
    font-size: 4.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 900px;
    color: #ffffff; /* H1 BLANCO */
    text-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); /* Sombra para que resalte sobre el Ávila */
  }

  .floating-pill {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    pointer-events: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--navy-dark);
  }

  .pill-pink { background: var(--pastel-pink); top: -25px; right: 15px; transform: rotate(3deg); }
  .pill-green { background: var(--pastel-green); top: 52%; left: -25px; transform: rotate(-6deg); }
  .pill-yellow { background: var(--pastel-yellow); bottom: -25px; right: 40px; transform: rotate(2deg); }

  /* TARJETA CASOS DERECHA */
  .glass-cases-card {
    grid-column: 3;
    grid-row: 1;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cases-min-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; }
  .cases-title-text { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  
  .search-icon-wrapper {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    border-radius: 50%;
    padding: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .cases-expand-content { max-height: 0; opacity: 0; transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }
  
  .glass-cases-card:hover .cases-expand-content,
  .glass-cases-card:focus .cases-expand-content {
    max-height: 320px; /* Aumentado por los nuevos casos */
    opacity: 1;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .quick-cases-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .quick-cases-list a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--navy-dark); display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: 12px; }
  .quick-cases-list strong { font-weight: 800; }
  .quick-cases-list span { font-size: 10.5px; color: #475569; margin-top: 2px;}

  /* DOCK FLOTANTE */
  .floating-dock {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 24px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 36px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    z-index: 9999;
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
  }

  .dock-list { display: flex; gap: 20px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; align-items: center; }
  .dock-item { position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .dock-link { display: flex; align-items: center; }

  .mac-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; object-fit: contain; transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); }
  .dock-link:hover .mac-icon { transform: scale(1.25) translateY(-4px); }

  .dock-item::before {
    content: attr(data-tooltip);
    position: absolute;
    top: -46px;
    background: var(--navy-dark);
    color: white;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .dock-item:hover::before { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; top: -50px; }

  /* MÓVIL: Reordenamiento y Ajustes */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .brand-centered { font-size: 16px; top: 20px; }
    
    .hero-container { 
      display: flex; 
      flex-direction: column; 
      gap: 16px; 
      margin-top: 50px; 
    }
    
    /* REORDENAR ELEMENTOS EN MÓVIL */
    .glass-profile-card { order: 1; }
    .hero-center-text { order: 2; margin-top: 10px; }
    .glass-cases-card { order: 3; }
    
    /* La frase gancho baja al final en móviles */
    .quote-text { 
      order: 4; 
      text-align: center; 
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero-center-text h1 { font-size: 2.6rem; }
    .floating-pill { display: none; }
    .floating-dock { padding: 10px 18px; }
    .mac-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
    .dock-list { gap: 16px; }
  }
</style>
